that's kind of weird.

00:04:52.171 --> 00:04:53.025
- [Deon] No.

00:04:53.025 --> 00:04:54.227
(Deon laughing)

00:04:54.227 --> 00:04:58.187
- I banked on this one job,
like, just to rub it in.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.970
So wait, do you remember how
you reacted when you first

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:03.520
