00:05:31.943 --> 00:05:33.246
(audience laughing)

00:05:33.246 --> 00:05:35.276
- Oh my gosh, that's
your first experience.

00:05:35.276 --> 00:05:38.210
- And I was like, I start
slowing down like, thank you.

